    "preservation_limit": "These hashes were recorded while reading the initial files. The author regenerated them before the reviewer copied full bytes. Do not misrepresent these hash-only observations as preserved original snapshots. Subsequent exact input files and all10 after payloads are preserved under round2; author separately preserved MA-SR-02-before bytes. The first finding and author response below are an explicitly reconstructed review ledger from this conversation, not an untouched original file."
